Modified by tasin-py starting on 15 November 2026, from the OpenBangla Keyboard
development branch (3.0.0, commit eea66af). The changes include renaming the
application, packages, input method engines and files; a new logo; removing the
Windows and macOS ports; a one-command installer; a best-effort package post-install
step; an added Qt SVG dependency; and new build, test and release workflows.
The full history of changes is in this repository's git history.

